 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Henry sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "Henry shows you where they go to think. \"Don't tell the others. Everyone needs one place.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "They go very still. Not relaxed-still. Held-still."
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Say that again where everyone can hear.\" A thin smile. \"Or don't. Your call.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Do you still count the days? I lost track days ago.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Good. Keep counting. The days need witnesses.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"I count meals, not days. Three meals since the rain. Two since the alarm. Days are for people with calendars. I have a stomach. That's the whole of it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Still on what day it is. Give it time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Maricela is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"I've got things to see to. Don't be a stranger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Have you — sorry. I keep thinking about them.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "Linda has an edge today — something curdled."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Victor glances around first. \"People are saying things. About you. Is any of it true?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Alright, duty calls. This was a good pause.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "The silence stretches a beat too long. They study their hands."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Is that so? It's quiet today. Wrong kind of quiet.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"I work alone. Nothing personal. ...It's a little personal.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"You're kind. Don't let this place change that. We all learn.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Victor was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "You show them Sassafras — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "«Привіт! Ти... як тебе звати?»"
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "«Правильно.» They nod back, slowly."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "«Дякую, що ти тут.» (you catch 'Дякую' — thank you) A grin breaks through, quick and warm."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "«Все буде добре.» (you catch 'добре' — good) You tap your chest, then theirs. Us. They nod, emphatic."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "A final shared look — you both feel the talk running its course."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Have you ever hurt someone? Since all this started.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "They nod, slow. \"Okay. Thank you for telling me. That couldn't have been easy to say.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I don't keep score on that. Score-keeping is how you stop sleeping. I do what the day needs and I don't rehearse it after.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Still on whether you've hurt someone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? What could go wrong.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Blanca always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "You show them Ghost Pipe — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Blanca. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Blanca was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I greet everyone by name each morning at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "You show them White Oak Acorns — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  }
 ],
