    "giftSample": [
     "Ines squares up to watch. \"Give it hell.\"",
     "💛 You hold Contract Quill. It has signed three leases, two loans, and one terrible contract you still regret. The penmanship was always excellent. The judgment, less so. Your gifts are not mastered —",
